  <body dur="04:52.120">
    <div begin="00:34.550" end="04:52.120">
      <p begin="00:34.550" end="00:41.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:34.550" end="00:35.570">願</span><span begin="00:35.570" end="00:35.740">え</span><span begin="00:35.800" end="00:36.980">ば</span><span begin="00:36.980" end="00:37.010">、</span><span begin="00:38.050" end="00:38.460">届</span><span begin="00:38.540" end="00:38.710">け</span><span begin="00:38.710" end="00:39.130">ら</span><span begin="00:39.130" end="00:39.390">れ</span><span begin="00:39.390" end="00:41.630">る</span><span begin="00:41.630" end="00:41.660">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要心怀祈愿 就能够传达出去吗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">只要心懷祈願 就能夠傳達出去嗎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If I wish hard enough will it get through?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">간절히 바라면 전할 수 있을까?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si je le souhaite pourrai-je te le faire parvenir ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si lo deseo ¿podré hacerlo llegar?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn ich es mir nur wünsche kann es dich erreichen?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se eu desejar será que conseguirei fazer chegar até você?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если пожелать смогу ли я донести это?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se lo desidero riuscirò a farlo arrivare?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Negaeba, todokerareru?</span></p>
      <p begin="00:43.440" end="00:50.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:43.440" end="00:44.050">メ</span><span begin="00:44.050" end="00:44.420">ロ</span><span begin="00:44.510" end="00:44.860">ディ</span><span begin="00:44.940" end="00:46.250">が</span><span begin="00:47.380" end="00:47.740">花</span><span begin="00:47.800" end="00:47.980">ひ</span><span begin="00:47.980" end="00:48.190">ら</span><span begin="00:48.270" end="00:48.530">く</span><span begin="00:48.570" end="00:48.980">よ</span><span begin="00:49.030" end="00:49.240">う</span><span begin="00:49.280" end="00:50.880">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同旋律悄然绽放成花</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如同旋律悄然綻放成花</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Like a melody bursting into bloom</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">선율이 꽃을 피워 내듯이</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme une mélodie qui éclot telle une fleur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como si la melodía floreciera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So wie eine Melodie ihre Blüten entfaltet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como uma melodia que desabrocha em flor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Словно мелодия распускается цветком</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come una melodia che sboccia in fiore</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Merodi ga hana hiraku you ni</span></p>
      <p begin="00:52.590" end="00:58.330" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:52.590" end="00:52.850">肯</span><span begin="00:52.920" end="00:53.240">定</span><span begin="00:53.620" end="00:53.710">で</span><span begin="00:53.770" end="00:54.010">き</span><span begin="00:54.070" end="00:54.290">な</span><span begin="00:54.290" end="00:54.360">い</span><span begin="00:54.360" end="00:54.610">で</span><span begin="00:54.940" end="00:55.110">追</span><span begin="00:55.110" end="00:55.250">い</span><span begin="00:55.250" end="00:55.330">出</span><span begin="00:55.360" end="00:55.470">し</span><span begin="00:55.540" end="00:55.800">た</span><span begin="00:56.060" end="00:56.490">夢</span><span begin="00:56.660" end="00:56.790">の</span><span begin="00:56.790" end="00:57.680">話</span><span begin="00:57.680" end="00:58.330">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些因无法认同而被我逐出的梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那些因無法認同而被我逐出的夢想</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The tale of a dream I cast away because I couldn't believe in it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">긍정하지 못해 내쫓아 버린 꿈의 이야기는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">L'histoire de ce rêve que j'ai chassé sans pouvoir l'accepter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La historia de aquel sueño que desterré por no poder aceptarlo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Geschichte jenes Traums den ich nicht annehmen konnte und von mir stieß</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A história daquele sonho que expulsei por não conseguir aceitá-lo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">История о мечте которую я не сумела принять и прогнала</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La storia di quel sogno che ho scacciato senza riuscire ad accettarlo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Koutei dekinaide oidashita yume no hanashi wa</span></p>
      <p begin="00:58.630" end="01:02.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:58.630" end="00:58.860">僕</span><span begin="00:58.920" end="00:59.050">の</span><span begin="00:59.050" end="00:59.510">中</span><span begin="00:59.510" end="00:59.770">を</span><span begin="01:00.160" end="01:00.340">そ</span><span begin="01:00.340" end="01:00.620">れ</span><span begin="01:00.620" end="01:00.800">で</span><span begin="01:00.800" end="01:01.050">も</span><span begin="01:01.360" end="01:01.800">離</span><span begin="01:01.800" end="01:01.940">れ</span><span begin="01:01.940" end="01:02.210">な</span><span begin="01:02.210" end="01:02.360">い</span><span begin="01:02.410" end="01:02.760">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便如此 依然留在我心底 不肯离去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">即便如此 依然留在我心底 不肯離去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even so it refuses to leave the depths of me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그럼에도 내 안에서 떠나지 않고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ne m'a pourtant jamais quittée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aun así nunca se apartó de mi interior</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wollte mich dennoch niemals verlassen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo assim jamais me abandonou</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Всё равно никак не покидает меня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Eppure continua a restare dentro di me</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Boku no naka o sore demo hanarenaide</span></p>
      <p begin="01:03.570" end="01:06.520" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="01:03.570" end="01:04.150">何</span><span begin="01:04.150" end="01:04.310">よ</span><span begin="01:04.310" end="01:04.500">り</span><span begin="01:04.760" end="01:05.750">眩</span><span begin="01:05.860" end="01:06.130">し</span><span begin="01:06.200" end="01:06.520">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">比任何事物都更加耀眼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">比任何事物都更加耀眼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Brighter than anything else</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그 무엇보다 눈부시게 빛나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Elle resplendit plus que toute autre chose</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Brilla más que cualquier otra cosa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Strahlender als alles andere</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mais radiante do que qualquer outra coisa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сияя ярче всего на свете</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Più splendente di qualsiasi altra cosa</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nani yori mabushii</span></p>
      <p begin="01:07.150" end="01:10.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="01:07.150" end="01:07.300">可</span><span begin="01:07.300" end="01:07.540">能</span><span begin="01:07.580" end="01:08.000">性</span><span begin="01:08.200" end="01:08.290">は</span><span begin="01:08.330" end="01:08.720">拡</span><span begin="01:08.770" end="01:09.290">張</span><span begin="01:09.350" end="01:09.670">す</span><span begin="01:09.670" end="01:09.990">る</span><span begin="01:09.990" end="01:10.150">ん</span><span begin="01:10.150" end="01:10.760">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可能性正在不断向外延展</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可能性正在不斷向外延展</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Possibilities keep expanding</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">가능성은 확장되는 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le champ des possibles ne cesse de s'étendre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Las posibilidades se expanden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Möglichkeiten weiten sich immer weiter aus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">As possibilidades continuam se expandindo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Возможности продолжают расширяться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Le possibilità continuano a espandersi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kanousei wa kakuchou surunda</span></p>
      <p begin="01:11.220" end="01:14.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="01:11.220" end="01:11.370">合</span><span begin="01:11.370" end="01:11.560">わ</span><span begin="01:11.560" end="01:11.630">せ</span><span begin="01:11.670" end="01:11.850">た</span><span begin="01:11.850" end="01:12.220">人</span><span begin="01:12.220" end="01:12.340">差</span><span begin="01:12.380" end="01:12.870">し</span><span begin="01:12.870" end="01:13.200">指</span><span begin="01:13.440" end="01:13.590">で</span><span begin="01:13.590" end="01:13.940">描</span><span begin="01:13.940" end="01:14.020">く</span><span begin="01:14.020" end="01:14.190">軌</span><span begin="01:14.290" end="01:14.920">跡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以相触的食指描绘出的轨迹</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">以相觸的食指描繪出的軌跡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The path we trace with our index fingers pressed together</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">서로 맞댄 검지로 그려 내는 궤적</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La trajectoire que dessinent nos index réunis</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La trayectoria que trazamos al juntar nuestros dedos índices</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Spur die wir mit aneinandergelegten Zeigefingern zeichnen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A trajetória desenhada com nossos dedos indicadores unidos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Путь что мы чертим соединив указательные пальцы</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La traiettoria tracciata dai nostri indici accostati</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Awaseta hitosashiyubi de egaku kiseki</span></p>
      <p begin="01:15.180" end="01:20.950" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="01:15.180" end="01:15.470">こ</span><span begin="01:15.470" end="01:15.640">れ</span><span begin="01:15.640" end="01:15.860">が</span><span begin="01:15.860" end="01:15.890">、</span><span begin="01:16.060" end="01:16.350">僕</span><span begin="01:16.350" end="01:16.500">ら</span><span begin="01:16.540" end="01:16.770">の</span><span begin="01:16.770" end="01:16.800">、</span><span begin="01:17.210" end="01:17.660">愛</span><span begin="01:17.660" end="01:17.900">の</span><span begin="01:17.900" end="01:17.930">、</span><span begin="01:18.350" end="01:18.690">存</span><span begin="01:18.690" end="01:19.280">在</span><span begin="01:19.280" end="01:19.470">の</span><span begin="01:19.470" end="01:19.500">、</span><span begin="01:19.830" end="01:20.250">証</span><span begin="01:20.330" end="01:20.950">明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是属于我们 属于爱 属于存在的证明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這便是屬於我們 屬於愛 屬於存在的證明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">This is proof of us of love of our very existence</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이것이 우리의 사랑의 존재의 증명이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Voilà la preuve de ce que nous sommes de notre amour de notre existence</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Esta es la prueba de nosotros de nuestro amor de nuestra existencia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das ist der Beweis für uns für unsere Liebe für unsere Existenz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esta é a prova de nós do nosso amor da nossa existência</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вот доказательство нас самих нашей любви нашего существования</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questa è la prova di noi del nostro amore della nostra esistenza</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kore ga, bokura no, ai no, sonzai no, shoumei</span></p>
      <p begin="01:20.950" end="01:24.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:20.950" end="01:21.770">今</span><span begin="01:21.770" end="01:21.800">、</span><span begin="01:22.140" end="01:22.770">始</span><span begin="01:22.770" end="01:22.980">ま</span><span begin="01:22.980" end="01:23.060">っ</span><span begin="01:23.060" end="01:23.280">て</span><span begin="01:23.330" end="01:23.590">し</span><span begin="01:23.650" end="01:23.910">ま</span><span begin="01:23.910" end="01:24.110">っ</span><span begin="01:24.110" end="01:24.730">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻 一切已然开始</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">此刻 一切已然開始</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Now it's already begun</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지금 시작되고 말았어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À présent tout a bel et bien commencé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ahora ya ha comenzado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jetzt hat es unwiderruflich begonnen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Agora tudo já começou</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И вот всё уже началось</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ormai tutto ha avuto inizio</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ima, hajimatte shimatta</span></p>
      <p begin="01:25.150" end="01:31.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:25.150" end="01:25.610">空</span><span begin="01:25.650" end="01:25.750">目</span><span begin="01:25.810" end="01:26.150">指</span><span begin="01:26.150" end="01:26.260">す</span><span begin="01:26.400" end="01:26.710">鳥</span><span begin="01:26.710" end="01:26.920">が</span><span begin="01:26.920" end="01:26.950">、</span><span begin="01:26.990" end="01:27.430">緑</span><span begin="01:27.430" end="01:27.600">が</span><span begin="01:27.600" end="01:27.660">行</span><span begin="01:27.720" end="01:27.870">き</span><span begin="01:27.910" end="01:27.960">つ</span><span begin="01:28.000" end="01:28.140">く</span><span begin="01:28.140" end="01:28.200">場</span><span begin="01:28.260" end="01:28.710">所</span><span begin="01:28.710" end="01:28.870">を</span><span begin="01:29.150" end="01:29.480">知</span><span begin="01:29.480" end="01:29.780">ら</span><span begin="01:29.820" end="01:30.050">な</span><span begin="01:30.050" end="01:30.130">い</span><span begin="01:30.370" end="01:30.790">よ</span><span begin="01:30.840" end="01:31.000">う</span><span begin="01:31.040" end="01:31.630">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像飞向天空的鸟 不知绿意终将抵达何方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就像飛向天空的鳥 不知綠意終將抵達何方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Like a bird soaring toward the sky unaware of where the green will go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하늘을 향하는 새가 푸르름이 닿을 곳을 알지 못하듯</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme l'oiseau qui aspire au ciel ignore jusqu'où parviendra la verdure</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como un ave que busca el cielo sin saber adónde llegará el verdor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So wie ein Vogel der zum Himmel strebt nicht weiß wohin das Grün gelangt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como o pássaro que busca o céu sem saber aonde o verde chegará</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Как птица устремлённая в небо не знает куда доберётся зелень</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come un uccello che punta al cielo senza sapere fin dove giungerà il verde</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sora mezasu tori ga, midori ga ikitsuku basho o shiranai you ni</span></p>
      <p begin="01:32.050" end="01:36.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:32.050" end="01:32.580">拡</span><span begin="01:32.640" end="01:33.210">散</span><span begin="01:33.550" end="01:33.750">し</span><span begin="01:33.870" end="01:34.270">て</span><span begin="01:34.710" end="01:34.940">ゆ</span><span begin="01:35.000" end="01:36.580">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍不断向远方扩散</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">仍不斷向遠方擴散</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Spreading ever outward</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">끝없이 퍼져 나가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tout se diffuse toujours plus loin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sigue extendiéndose</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Breitet es sich immer weiter aus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Continuamos a nos espalhar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Распространяясь всё дальше</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Continua a diffondersi sempre più lontano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kakusan shite yuku</span></p>
      <p begin="01:45.720" end="01:49.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:45.720" end="01:46.100">白</span><span begin="01:46.190" end="01:46.650">昼</span><span begin="01:46.650" end="01:47.090">夢</span><span begin="01:47.090" end="01:47.320">の</span><span begin="01:47.320" end="01:48.050">色</span><span begin="01:48.100" end="01:48.380">に</span><span begin="01:48.670" end="01:48.830">触</span><span begin="01:48.830" end="01:48.960">れ</span><span begin="01:49.120" end="01:49.420">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">触碰到了白日梦的色彩</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">觸碰到了白日夢的色彩</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I touched the colors of a daydream</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">백일몽의 빛깔에 닿았어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J'ai effleuré les couleurs d'un rêve éveillé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Toqué los colores de un sueño a plena luz del día</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich berührte die Farben eines Tagtraums</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Toquei as cores de um devaneio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я коснулась красок грёз наяву</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ho sfiorato i colori di un sogno a occhi aperti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hakuchuumu no iro ni fureta</span></p>
      <p begin="01:49.660" end="01:53.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:49.660" end="01:49.750">時</span><span begin="01:49.840" end="01:50.730">空</span><span begin="01:50.730" end="01:51.100">の</span><span begin="01:51.170" end="01:51.590">ド</span><span begin="01:51.590" end="01:51.860">ア</span><span begin="01:51.860" end="01:52.160">を</span><span begin="01:52.440" end="01:53.190">開</span><span begin="01:53.190" end="01:53.290">い</span><span begin="01:53.340" end="01:53.630">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">推开了通往时空的门扉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">推開了通往時空的門扉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I opened the door through space and time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">시공간의 문을 열었어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J'ai ouvert la porte de l'espace-temps</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Abrí la puerta del espacio y del tiempo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich öffnete die Tür zu Raum und Zeit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Abri a porta do espaço-tempo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Открыла дверь сквозь пространство и время</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ho spalancato la porta dello spazio e del tempo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Jikuu no doa o hiraita</span></p>
      <p begin="01:53.870" end="01:58.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:53.870" end="01:54.280">傷</span><span begin="01:54.340" end="01:55.080">口</span><span begin="01:55.250" end="01:55.510">は</span><span begin="01:55.660" end="01:55.940">ま</span><span begin="01:55.940" end="01:56.170">だ</span><span begin="01:56.380" end="01:57.070">痛</span><span begin="01:57.070" end="01:57.260">む</span><span begin="01:57.260" end="01:57.550">ま</span><span begin="01:57.700" end="01:57.980">ま</span><span begin="01:57.980" end="01:58.370">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伤口依旧隐隐作痛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">傷口依舊隱隱作痛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The wound is still aching</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">상처는 아직도 아픈 그대로지만</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mes blessures me font encore mal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Las heridas todavía siguen doliendo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Wunden schmerzen noch immer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">As feridas ainda continuam doendo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Раны всё ещё продолжают болеть</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Le ferite fanno ancora male</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kizuguchi wa mada itamu mama de</span></p>
      <p begin="01:58.810" end="02:02.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:58.810" end="01:58.980">そ</span><span begin="01:58.980" end="01:59.110">れ</span><span begin="01:59.110" end="01:59.240">で</span><span begin="01:59.290" end="01:59.530">も</span><span begin="01:59.530" end="02:00.010">羽</span><span begin="02:00.010" end="02:00.280">を</span><span begin="02:00.620" end="02:01.480">動</span><span begin="02:01.480" end="02:01.710">か</span><span begin="02:01.780" end="02:02.070">す</span><span begin="02:02.070" end="02:02.390">ん</span><span begin="02:02.390" end="02:02.660">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便如此 也要振翅向前</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">即便如此 也要振翅向前</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even so I keep beating my wings</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그럼에도 날개를 움직이는 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et pourtant je continue de battre des ailes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y aun así sigo batiendo las alas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und dennoch schlage ich weiter mit meinen Flügeln</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo assim continuo batendo as asas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И всё же я продолжаю взмахивать крыльями</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Eppure continuo a battere le ali</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore demo hane o ugokasunda</span></p>
      <p begin="02:02.910" end="02:06.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="02:02.910" end="02:02.940">「</span><span begin="02:02.940" end="02:03.380">演</span><span begin="02:03.380" end="02:03.480">じ</span><span begin="02:03.540" end="02:03.920">続</span><span begin="02:03.970" end="02:04.140">け</span><span begin="02:04.140" end="02:04.450">ら</span><span begin="02:04.450" end="02:04.790">れ</span><span begin="02:04.850" end="02:05.230">た</span><span begin="02:05.300" end="02:05.640">と</span><span begin="02:05.710" end="02:06.060">し</span><span begin="02:06.150" end="02:06.370">て</span><span begin="02:06.470" end="02:06.730">も</span><span begin="02:06.730" end="02:06.760">」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">「即使能够一直扮演下去」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">「即使能夠一直扮演下去」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">"Even if I could keep playing the part"</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">「계속 연기할 수 있다 해도」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">« Même si je pouvais continuer à jouer mon rôle »</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">«Aunque pudiera seguir interpretando mi papel»</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">„Selbst wenn ich meine Rolle ewig weiterspielen könnte“</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">«Mesmo que eu consiga continuar representando meu papel»</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">«Даже если я смогу продолжать играть свою роль»</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">«Anche se riuscissi a continuare a recitare»</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">"Enjitsuzukerareta to shite mo"</span></p>
      <p begin="02:07.600" end="02:11.620" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="02:07.600" end="02:07.930">数</span><span begin="02:07.930" end="02:08.060">は</span><span begin="02:08.060" end="02:08.440">僕</span><span begin="02:08.780" end="02:08.910">ら</span><span begin="02:08.910" end="02:09.010">を</span><span begin="02:09.070" end="02:09.410">計</span><span begin="02:09.480" end="02:09.840">測</span><span begin="02:09.900" end="02:10.370">す</span><span begin="02:10.370" end="02:10.740">る</span><span begin="02:10.820" end="02:11.170">だ</span><span begin="02:11.260" end="02:11.620">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">数字所能做的 不过是丈量我们</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">數字所能做的 不過是丈量我們</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Numbers can only measure us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">숫자는 그저 우리를 측정할 뿐</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les chiffres ne font que nous mesurer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Los números solo pueden medirnos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Zahlen können uns nur vermessen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Os números apenas nos medem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Числа способны лишь измерять нас</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">I numeri non fanno altro che misurarci</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kazu wa bokura o keisoku suru dake</span></p>
      <p begin="02:12.220" end="02:15.410" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="02:12.220" end="02:12.450">不</span><span begin="02:12.530" end="02:13.100">在</span><span begin="02:13.150" end="02:13.370">な</span><span begin="02:13.440" end="02:13.670">自</span><span begin="02:13.750" end="02:14.320">分</span><span begin="02:14.320" end="02:14.570">の</span><span begin="02:14.630" end="02:15.200">息</span><span begin="02:15.200" end="02:15.410">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那个仿佛已然缺席的自己的呼吸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那個彷彿已然缺席的自己的呼吸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The breath of my absent self</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">존재하지 않는 나 자신의 숨결을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le souffle de ce moi absent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El aliento de ese yo ausente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Den Atem meines abwesenden Ichs</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A respiração daquele eu que já não está presente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Дыхание моего отсутствующего «я»</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il respiro del mio io assente</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Fuzai na jibun no iki o</span></p>
      <p begin="02:15.750" end="02:22.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="02:15.750" end="02:16.080">感</span><span begin="02:16.080" end="02:16.520">じ</span><span begin="02:16.520" end="02:16.850">る</span><span begin="02:16.920" end="02:17.320">こ</span><span begin="02:17.350" end="02:17.510">と</span><span begin="02:17.510" end="02:17.770">が</span><span begin="02:18.110" end="02:18.420">ま</span><span begin="02:18.420" end="02:18.790">だ</span><span begin="02:19.280" end="02:19.460">で</span><span begin="02:19.580" end="02:20.050">き</span><span begin="02:20.050" end="02:20.370">る</span><span begin="02:20.430" end="02:22.360">か</span><span begin="02:22.360" end="02:22.390">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今是否还能感受得到呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如今是否還能感受得到呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Can I still feel it?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아직도 느낄 수 있을까?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Puis-je encore le ressentir ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Todavía puedo sentirlo?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Kann ich ihn noch immer spüren?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Será que ainda consigo senti-la?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Могу ли я всё ещё его почувствовать?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Riesco ancora a sentirlo?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kanjiru koto ga mada dekiru ka?</span></p>
      <p begin="02:22.780" end="02:30.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="02:22.780" end="02:23.900">願</span><span begin="02:23.900" end="02:24.170">い</span><span begin="02:24.170" end="02:25.320">は</span><span begin="02:26.390" end="02:26.860">叶</span><span begin="02:26.860" end="02:27.060">え</span><span begin="02:27.060" end="02:27.410">ら</span><span begin="02:27.460" end="02:27.730">れ</span><span begin="02:27.730" end="02:30.060">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿望终究是能够实现的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">願望終究是能夠實現的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Wishes can come true</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">소원은 이루어질 수 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les souhaits peuvent se réaliser</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Los deseos pueden hacerse realidad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wünsche können in Erfüllung gehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Os desejos podem se realizar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Желания могут сбываться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">I desideri possono avverarsi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Negai wa kanaerareru</span></p>
      <p begin="02:31.790" end="02:38.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="02:31.790" end="02:32.290">失</span><span begin="02:32.370" end="02:33.100">く</span><span begin="02:33.100" end="02:33.260">し</span><span begin="02:33.260" end="02:33.480">て</span><span begin="02:33.480" end="02:33.910">も</span><span begin="02:34.220" end="02:34.950">答</span><span begin="02:34.950" end="02:35.240">え</span><span begin="02:35.240" end="02:35.490">が</span><span begin="02:35.550" end="02:35.710">ま</span><span begin="02:35.710" end="02:35.890">だ</span><span begin="02:36.150" end="02:36.750">響</span><span begin="02:36.750" end="02:36.930">い</span><span begin="02:37.060" end="02:37.540">て</span><span begin="02:37.540" end="02:38.700">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使有所失去 答案依然回响不息</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">即使有所失去 答案依然迴響不息</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even if I lose it the answer still echoes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">잃어버려도 답은 여전히 울려 퍼지고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même si je le perds la réponse résonne encore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aunque lo pierda la respuesta todavía resuena</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Selbst wenn ich es verliere hallt die Antwort noch immer nach</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo após a perda a resposta continua ecoando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже после утраты ответ всё ещё звучит</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche dopo averlo perduto la risposta risuona ancora</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nakushite mo kotae ga mada hibiiteru</span></p>
      <p begin="02:49.840" end="02:56.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="02:49.840" end="02:51.030">埋</span><span begin="02:51.140" end="02:51.500">め</span><span begin="02:51.600" end="02:51.940">た</span><span begin="02:52.040" end="02:52.370">こ</span><span begin="02:52.490" end="02:52.800">と</span><span begin="02:52.800" end="02:53.000">を</span><span begin="02:53.200" end="02:53.830">忘</span><span begin="02:53.830" end="02:54.170">れ</span><span begin="02:54.260" end="02:54.590">た</span><span begin="02:54.680" end="02:55.440">種</span><span begin="02:55.550" end="02:56.250">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连那颗早已忘记曾经埋下的种子</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就連那顆早已忘記曾經埋下的種子</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even the seeds I forgot I'd buried</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">묻어 두었다는 것조차 잊어버린 씨앗도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et si même cette graine que j'avais oublié avoir enfouie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Incluso las semillas que olvidé haber enterrado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Selbst die Samen von denen ich vergaß dass ich sie einst vergrub</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Até a semente que esqueci ter enterrado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже семя которое я закопала и забыла</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perfino i semi che ho dimenticato di aver sepolto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Uzumeta koto o wasureta tane mo</span></p>
      <p begin="02:56.660" end="03:02.710" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="02:56.660" end="02:56.750">芽</span><span begin="02:56.820" end="02:57.280">吹</span><span begin="02:57.280" end="02:57.630">い</span><span begin="02:57.740" end="02:58.120">て</span><span begin="02:58.530" end="02:58.910">世</span><span begin="02:58.990" end="02:59.450">界</span><span begin="02:59.450" end="02:59.740">を</span><span begin="03:00.040" end="03:00.260">描</span><span begin="03:00.350" end="03:00.680">き</span><span begin="03:00.760" end="03:01.080">足</span><span begin="03:01.080" end="03:01.160">し</span><span begin="03:01.200" end="03:01.470">て</span><span begin="03:01.470" end="03:01.650">く</span><span begin="03:01.650" end="03:02.020">な</span><span begin="03:02.070" end="03:02.680">ら</span><span begin="03:02.680" end="03:02.710">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若也能破土萌芽 为世界添上新的色彩呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">若也能破土萌芽 為世界添上新的色彩呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If they sprout and paint new strokes into the world?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">싹을 틔워 세상을 덧그려 나간다면?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Germait pour ajouter de nouveaux traits au dessin du monde ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Y si brotan y siguen dibujando el mundo?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn sie sprießen und das Bild der Welt weiterzeichnen?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E se ela germinar e acrescentar novos traços ao mundo?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если оно прорастёт и дорисует картину мира?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se germogliassero e aggiungessero nuovi tratti al mondo?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mebuite sekai o egakitashiteku nara?</span></p>
      <p begin="03:02.970" end="03:07.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="03:02.970" end="03:03.450">今</span><span begin="03:04.400" end="03:04.600">こ</span><span begin="03:04.700" end="03:05.100">こ</span><span begin="03:05.160" end="03:05.450">に</span><span begin="03:05.450" end="03:05.610">い</span><span begin="03:05.610" end="03:05.980">る</span><span begin="03:06.060" end="03:06.760">僕</span><span begin="03:06.760" end="03:07.100">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻身处这里的我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">此刻身處這裡的我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The me who is here right now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지금 이곳에 있는 나는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Moi qui suis ici en cet instant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Yo que estoy aquí en este instante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dieses Ich das jetzt hier ist</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu que estou aqui agora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я что нахожусь здесь и сейчас</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Io che sono qui proprio adesso</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ima koko ni iru boku wa</span></p>
      <p begin="03:07.160" end="03:10.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="03:07.160" end="03:07.580">今</span><span begin="03:07.900" end="03:08.120">こ</span><span begin="03:08.170" end="03:08.550">こ</span><span begin="03:08.600" end="03:08.890">に</span><span begin="03:08.890" end="03:09.090">あ</span><span begin="03:09.090" end="03:09.400">る</span><span begin="03:09.440" end="03:09.840">意</span><span begin="03:09.910" end="03:10.220">思</span><span begin="03:10.220" end="03:10.860">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻依然存在的这份意志</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">此刻依然存在的這份意志</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The will that exists here right now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지금 이곳에 존재하는 의지는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Cette volonté qui existe ici en cet instant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Esta voluntad que existe aquí y ahora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dieser Wille der jetzt hier existiert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esta vontade que existe aqui agora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Воля что существует здесь и сейчас</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questa volontà che esiste qui e ora</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ima koko ni aru ishi wa</span></p>
      <p begin="03:11.420" end="03:17.140" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="03:11.420" end="03:12.590">何</span><span begin="03:12.590" end="03:13.050">を</span><span begin="03:14.020" end="03:14.320">変</span><span begin="03:14.320" end="03:14.730">え</span><span begin="03:15.190" end="03:15.780">ら</span><span begin="03:15.780" end="03:16.070">れ</span><span begin="03:16.070" end="03:17.110">る……</span><span begin="03:17.110" end="03:17.140">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟能够改变些什么……？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">究竟能夠改變些什麼……？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">What can they change…?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">무엇을 바꿀 수 있을까……?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Que pouvons-nous changer… ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Qué podríamos cambiar…?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Was kann ich damit verändern…?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O que somos capazes de transformar…?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Что же мы способны изменить…?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Che cosa potranno cambiare…?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nani o kaerareru…?</span></p>
      <p begin="03:17.630" end="03:21.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="03:17.630" end="03:17.790">可</span><span begin="03:17.790" end="03:18.040">能</span><span begin="03:18.080" end="03:18.460">性</span><span begin="03:18.660" end="03:18.760">は</span><span begin="03:18.800" end="03:19.190">拡</span><span begin="03:19.240" end="03:19.750">張</span><span begin="03:19.810" end="03:20.150">す</span><span begin="03:20.150" end="03:20.460">る</span><span begin="03:20.460" end="03:20.630">ん</span><span begin="03:20.630" end="03:21.240">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可能性正在不断向外延展</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可能性正在不斷向外延展</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Possibilities keep expanding</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">가능성은 확장되는 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le champ des possibles ne cesse de s'étendre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Las posibilidades se expanden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Möglichkeiten weiten sich immer weiter aus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">As possibilidades continuam se expandindo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Возможности продолжают расширяться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Le possibilità continuano a espandersi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kanousei wa kakuchou surunda</span></p>
      <p begin="03:21.720" end="03:25.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="03:21.720" end="03:21.830">伸</span><span begin="03:21.880" end="03:22.080">ば</span><span begin="03:22.080" end="03:22.180">し</span><span begin="03:22.180" end="03:22.330">た</span><span begin="03:22.330" end="03:22.630">腕</span><span begin="03:22.630" end="03:22.790">は</span><span begin="03:22.960" end="03:23.030">無</span><span begin="03:23.080" end="03:23.340">我</span><span begin="03:23.370" end="03:23.440">夢</span><span begin="03:23.510" end="03:24.150">中</span><span begin="03:24.240" end="03:24.430">の</span><span begin="03:24.500" end="03:25.440">彼方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伸出的手臂 探向忘我追寻的远方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">伸出的手臂 探向忘我追尋的遠方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">My outstretched arms reach beyond all thought</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">뻗어 낸 팔은 정신없이 나아간 저 너머로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mon bras tendu dépasse l'horizon de cet élan éperdu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Los brazos extendidos hacia un horizonte más allá de todo arrebato</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mein ausgestreckter Arm reicht weit über alle Selbstvergessenheit hinaus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Os braços estendidos alcançam além do próprio arrebatamento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Протянутая рука устремлена за пределы самозабвения</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il braccio teso oltre ogni pensiero di me stesso</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nobashita ude wa mugamuchuu no kanata</span></p>
      <p begin="03:25.680" end="03:31.410" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="03:25.680" end="03:25.800">名</span><span begin="03:25.850" end="03:26.080">も</span><span begin="03:26.140" end="03:26.310">な</span><span begin="03:26.310" end="03:26.370">い</span><span begin="03:26.410" end="03:26.810">言</span><span begin="03:26.850" end="03:27.030">葉</span><span begin="03:27.030" end="03:27.280">を</span><span begin="03:27.720" end="03:28.080">一</span><span begin="03:28.170" end="03:28.420">つ</span><span begin="03:28.420" end="03:28.450">、</span><span begin="03:28.840" end="03:29.080">孤</span><span begin="03:29.160" end="03:29.720">独</span><span begin="03:29.720" end="03:29.960">の</span><span begin="03:30.290" end="03:30.660">肯</span><span begin="03:30.740" end="03:31.410">定</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一个尚无名字的词语 便是对孤独的肯定</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">一個尚無名字的詞語 便是對孤獨的肯定</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">One nameless word an affirmation of solitude</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이름 없는 말 하나 고독에 대한 긍정</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un seul mot sans nom l'affirmation de la solitude</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Una palabra sin nombre la afirmación de la soledad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein einziges namenloses Wort die Bejahung der Einsamkeit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Uma única palavra sem nome a afirmação da solidão</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Одно безымянное слово — признание одиночества</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Una sola parola senza nome per affermare la solitudine</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Na mo nai kotoba o hitotsu, kodoku no koutei</span></p>
      <p begin="03:31.410" end="03:34.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="03:31.410" end="03:32.200">今</span><span begin="03:32.200" end="03:32.230">、</span><span begin="03:32.630" end="03:32.880">駆</span><span begin="03:32.940" end="03:33.250">け</span><span begin="03:33.250" end="03:33.440">出</span><span begin="03:33.440" end="03:33.560">し</span><span begin="03:33.560" end="03:33.770">て</span><span begin="03:33.820" end="03:34.050">し</span><span begin="03:34.140" end="03:34.390">ま</span><span begin="03:34.390" end="03:34.580">っ</span><span begin="03:34.580" end="03:34.780">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻 已然奔向前方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">此刻 已然奔向前方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Now I've already broken into a run</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지금 달려 나가고 말았어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À présent je me suis élancée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ahora ya he echado a correr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jetzt bin ich einfach losgerannt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Agora já me lancei em disparada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И вот я уже сорвалась с места</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ormai mi sono lanciato nella corsa</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ima, kakedashite shimatta</span></p>
      <p begin="03:35.000" end="03:36.680" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="03:35.000" end="03:35.170">振</span><span begin="03:35.170" end="03:35.450">り</span><span begin="03:35.450" end="03:35.680">落</span><span begin="03:35.740" end="03:35.920">と</span><span begin="03:35.920" end="03:36.020">し</span><span begin="03:36.060" end="03:36.270">て</span><span begin="03:36.270" end="03:36.340">ゆ</span><span begin="03:36.340" end="03:36.680">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管将一切甩落身后吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">儘管將一切甩落身後吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Shake it off as you go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">떨쳐 내며 나아가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Secoue tout pour t'en défaire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sacúdete todo y sigue adelante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Schüttle alles von dir ab und geh weiter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sacuda tudo para longe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сбрось с себя всё и двигайся дальше</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Scrollati tutto di dosso e prosegui</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Furiotoshite yuke</span></p>
      <p begin="03:36.880" end="03:45.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="03:36.880" end="03:37.240">優</span><span begin="03:37.290" end="03:37.400">し</span><span begin="03:37.440" end="03:37.640">く</span><span begin="03:37.890" end="03:38.380">包</span><span begin="03:38.380" end="03:38.540">む</span><span begin="03:38.590" end="03:38.700">価</span><span begin="03:38.780" end="03:39.220">値</span><span begin="03:39.220" end="03:39.400">が</span><span begin="03:39.640" end="03:40.220">枷</span><span begin="03:40.270" end="03:40.480">に</span><span begin="03:40.840" end="03:41.430">な</span><span begin="03:41.430" end="03:42.230">る</span><span begin="03:42.860" end="03:43.810">前</span><span begin="03:43.910" end="03:45.700">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在那些被温柔珍视的价值化作枷锁之前</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在那些被溫柔珍視的價值化作枷鎖之前</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Before the values that gently embrace you become shackles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">다정하게 감싸 주는 가치가 족쇄가 되기 전에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Avant que la valeur de cette tendre protection ne devienne une entrave</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Antes de que aquello que te envuelve con ternura se convierta en cadenas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Bevor der Wert dessen was uns sanft umhüllt zur Fessel wird</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Antes que o valor que nos envolve com ternura se torne um grilhão</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Пока ценность что нежно обнимает тебя не превратилась в оковы</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Prima che ciò che ci avvolge con dolcezza diventi una catena</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yasashiku tsutsumu kachi ga kase ni naru mae ni</span></p>
      <p begin="04:04.280" end="04:11.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="04:04.280" end="04:05.250">願</span><span begin="04:05.250" end="04:05.480">え</span><span begin="04:05.520" end="04:06.680">ば</span><span begin="04:06.680" end="04:06.710">、</span><span begin="04:07.730" end="04:08.150">届</span><span begin="04:08.200" end="04:08.370">け</span><span begin="04:08.370" end="04:08.820">ら</span><span begin="04:08.820" end="04:09.080">れ</span><span begin="04:09.080" end="04:11.380">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要心怀祈愿 就一定能够传达出去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">只要心懷祈願 就一定能夠傳達出去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If I wish hard enough I can make it reach</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">간절히 바라면 전할 수 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si je le souhaite je peux te le faire parvenir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si lo deseo podré hacerlo llegar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn ich es mir nur wünsche kann es dich erreichen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se eu desejar conseguirei fazer chegar até você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если пожелать я смогу донести это</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se lo desidero riuscirò a farlo arrivare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Negaeba, todokerareru</span></p>
      <p begin="04:13.120" end="04:19.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="04:13.120" end="04:13.740">メ</span><span begin="04:13.740" end="04:14.130">ロ</span><span begin="04:14.190" end="04:14.560">ディ</span><span begin="04:14.600" end="04:15.950">が</span><span begin="04:17.040" end="04:17.480">花</span><span begin="04:17.480" end="04:17.670">ひ</span><span begin="04:17.670" end="04:17.920">ら</span><span begin="04:17.970" end="04:18.260">く</span><span begin="04:18.260" end="04:18.550">よ</span><span begin="04:18.550" end="04:18.720">う</span><span begin="04:18.720" end="04:19.990">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同旋律悄然绽放成花</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如同旋律悄然綻放成花</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Like a melody bursting into bloom</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">선율이 꽃을 피워 내듯이</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme une mélodie qui éclot telle une fleur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como si la melodía floreciera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So wie eine Melodie ihre Blüten entfaltet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como uma melodia que desabrocha em flor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Словно мелодия распускается цветком</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come una melodia che sboccia in fiore</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Merodi ga hana hiraku you ni</span></p>
      <p begin="04:20.420" end="04:22.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="04:20.420" end="04:20.620">ま</span><span begin="04:20.700" end="04:21.160">た</span><span begin="04:21.160" end="04:21.510">ひ</span><span begin="04:21.610" end="04:21.980">と</span><span begin="04:22.060" end="04:22.370">つ……</span><span begin="04:22.370" end="04:22.400">！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又有一个……！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">又有一個……！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And one more…!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">또 하나……!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Encore une fois… !</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¡Una vez más…!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Noch eine weitere…!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mais uma vez…!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И ещё одно…!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ancora una…!</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mata hitotsu…!</span></p>
      <p begin="04:22.750" end="04:26.490" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="04:22.750" end="04:22.960">可</span><span begin="04:23.050" end="04:23.280">能</span><span begin="04:23.330" end="04:23.750">性</span><span begin="04:23.930" end="04:24.030">が</span><span begin="04:24.030" end="04:24.430">拡</span><span begin="04:24.480" end="04:24.960">張</span><span begin="04:25.040" end="04:25.400">す</span><span begin="04:25.400" end="04:25.690">る</span><span begin="04:25.690" end="04:25.850">ん</span><span begin="04:25.850" end="04:26.460">だ</span><span begin="04:26.460" end="04:26.490">！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可能性正在不断扩张！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可能性正在不斷擴張！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Possibilities keep expanding!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">가능성이 확장되는 거야!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le champ des possibles s'étend encore !</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¡Las posibilidades se expanden!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Möglichkeiten weiten sich immer weiter aus!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">As possibilidades continuam se expandindo!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Возможности продолжают расширяться!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Le possibilità continuano a espandersi!</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kanousei ga kakuchou surunda!</span></p>
      <p begin="04:26.940" end="04:30.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="04:26.940" end="04:27.240">重</span><span begin="04:27.270" end="04:27.460">な</span><span begin="04:27.460" end="04:27.550">っ</span><span begin="04:27.550" end="04:27.910">た</span><span begin="04:28.150" end="04:28.760">心</span><span begin="04:28.760" end="04:28.970">で</span><span begin="04:29.150" end="04:29.380">起</span><span begin="04:29.430" end="04:29.590">こ</span><span begin="04:29.590" end="04:29.710">す</span><span begin="04:29.750" end="04:29.920">奇</span><span begin="04:30.020" end="04:30.740">跡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">由彼此交叠的心灵创造出的奇迹</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">由彼此交疊的心靈創造出的奇蹟</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A miracle born from our hearts coming together</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">서로 포개진 마음으로 일으키는 기적</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le miracle que nos cœurs unis accomplissent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El milagro que creamos con nuestros corazones entrelazados</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das Wunder das unsere vereinten Herzen vollbringen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O milagre que fazemos acontecer com nossos corações unidos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Чудо рождённое слиянием наших сердец</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il miracolo che facciamo nascere dai nostri cuori uniti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kasanatta kokoro de okosu kiseki</span></p>
      <p begin="04:30.930" end="04:36.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="04:30.930" end="04:31.220">こ</span><span begin="04:31.220" end="04:31.390">れ</span><span begin="04:31.390" end="04:31.610">が</span><span begin="04:31.610" end="04:31.640">、</span><span begin="04:31.810" end="04:32.100">僕</span><span begin="04:32.100" end="04:32.270">ら</span><span begin="04:32.310" end="04:32.510">の</span><span begin="04:32.510" end="04:32.540">、</span><span begin="04:32.950" end="04:33.400">愛</span><span begin="04:33.400" end="04:33.630">の</span><span begin="04:33.630" end="04:33.660">、</span><span begin="04:34.080" end="04:34.400">存</span><span begin="04:34.400" end="04:34.980">在</span><span begin="04:35.020" end="04:35.200">の</span><span begin="04:35.200" end="04:35.230">、</span><span begin="04:35.560" end="04:35.960">証</span><span begin="04:36.030" end="04:36.640">明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是属于我们 属于爱 属于存在的证明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這便是屬於我們 屬於愛 屬於存在的證明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">This is proof of us of love of our very existence</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이것이 우리의 사랑의 존재의 증명이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Voilà la preuve de ce que nous sommes de notre amour de notre existence</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Esta es la prueba de nosotros de nuestro amor de nuestra existencia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das ist der Beweis für uns für unsere Liebe für unsere Existenz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esta é a prova de nós do nosso amor da nossa existência</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вот доказательство нас самих нашей любви нашего существования</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questa è la prova di noi del nostro amore della nostra esistenza</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kore ga, bokura no, ai no, sonzai no, shoumei</span></p>
      <p begin="04:36.640" end="04:40.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="04:36.640" end="04:37.480">今</span><span begin="04:37.480" end="04:37.510">、</span><span begin="04:37.850" end="04:38.470">始</span><span begin="04:38.470" end="04:38.660">ま</span><span begin="04:38.660" end="04:38.780">っ</span><span begin="04:38.780" end="04:39.010">て</span><span begin="04:39.060" end="04:39.310">し</span><span begin="04:39.400" end="04:39.620">ま</span><span begin="04:39.620" end="04:39.830">っ</span><span begin="04:39.830" end="04:40.440">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻 一切已然开始</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">此刻 一切已然開始</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Now it's already begun</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지금 시작되고 말았어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À présent tout a bel et bien commencé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ahora ya ha comenzado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jetzt hat es unwiderruflich begonnen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Agora tudo já começou</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И вот всё уже началось</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ormai tutto ha avuto inizio</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ima, hajimatte shimatta</span></p>
      <p begin="04:40.920" end="04:47.330" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="04:40.920" end="04:41.350">空</span><span begin="04:41.390" end="04:41.470">目</span><span begin="04:41.530" end="04:41.880">指</span><span begin="04:41.880" end="04:41.990">す</span><span begin="04:42.130" end="04:42.430">鳥</span><span begin="04:42.430" end="04:42.650">が</span><span begin="04:42.650" end="04:42.680">、</span><span begin="04:42.720" end="04:43.160">緑</span><span begin="04:43.160" end="04:43.330">が</span><span begin="04:43.330" end="04:43.390">行</span><span begin="04:43.450" end="04:43.590">き</span><span begin="04:43.630" end="04:43.700">つ</span><span begin="04:43.740" end="04:43.880">く</span><span begin="04:43.880" end="04:43.950">場</span><span begin="04:44.010" end="04:44.470">所</span><span begin="04:44.470" end="04:44.600">を</span><span begin="04:44.880" end="04:45.180">知</span><span begin="04:45.180" end="04:45.460">ら</span><span begin="04:45.500" end="04:45.730">な</span><span begin="04:45.730" end="04:45.830">い</span><span begin="04:46.070" end="04:46.440">よ</span><span begin="04:46.490" end="04:46.650">う</span><span begin="04:46.690" end="04:47.330">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像飞向天空的鸟 不知绿意终将抵达何方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就像飛向天空的鳥 不知綠意終將抵達何方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Like a bird soaring toward the sky unaware of where the green will go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하늘을 향하는 새가 푸르름이 닿을 곳을 알지 못하듯</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme l'oiseau qui aspire au ciel ignore jusqu'où parviendra la verdure</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como un ave que busca el cielo sin saber adónde llegará el verdor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So wie ein Vogel der zum Himmel strebt nicht weiß wohin das Grün gelangt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como o pássaro que busca o céu sem saber aonde o verde chegará</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Как птица устремлённая в небо не знает куда доберётся зелень</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come un uccello che punta al cielo senza sapere fin dove giungerà il verde</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sora mezasu tori ga, midori ga ikitsuku basho o shiranai you ni</span></p>
      <p begin="04:47.820" end="04:52.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="04:47.820" end="04:48.330">拡</span><span begin="04:48.390" end="04:48.910">散</span><span begin="04:49.250" end="04:49.450">し</span><span begin="04:49.570" end="04:49.820">て</span><span begin="04:50.160" end="04:50.670">ゆ</span><span begin="04:50.730" end="04:52.120">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍不断向远方扩散</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">仍不斷向遠方擴散</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Spreading ever outward</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">끝없이 퍼져 나가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tout se diffuse toujours plus loin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sigue extendiéndose</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Breitet es sich immer weiter aus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Continuamos a nos espalhar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Распространяясь всё дальше</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Continua a diffondersi sempre più lontano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kakusan shite yuku</span></p>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>
